{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17215060","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17215060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721506001:1":{"text":"...사령관님, 왕자님.","source_cn":"……司令，殿下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC15AFA8BBEB06CD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721506002:1":{"text":"귀네스 분대장! 어떻게 된 일인지 설명해!","source_cn":"格温妮丝队长！解释你的行为！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3213358F94848CC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721506003:1":{"text":"허가 없이 근무지를 이탈하고, 몰래 왕자님께 드리는 군사 보고를 엿듣다니?!","source_cn":"未经许可擅离职守，还躲在暗处窃听王储的高级军事汇报？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B5BADB3EB32BC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721506004:2":{"text":"죄송합니다, 사령관님! 왕궁에 오셨다는 소식을 듣고 급한 마음에 달려왔습니다. 제 과실입니다!","source_cn":"万分抱歉，司令！属下听闻王宫内有您出现的消息，一时情急...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3091A9B8D765DDEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721506005:1":{"text":"그만두게, 헨드릭 경. 군영이 아니니 그렇게 다그칠 필요는 없지 않은가.","source_cn":"好了，亨德里克卿，不必如此苛责。这里可不是军营。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE420A61FE47BB6C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721506006:1":{"text":"귀네스 경도 그대의 안위를 걱정한 것뿐이니, 딸에게 너무 엄격하게 굴지 말게.","source_cn":"格温妮丝也是因为担心你的安危才会乱了方寸，别对自己的女...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06B48FCC492E54DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721506007:1":{"text":"하지만 군법은 군법입니다. 귀네스 분대장, 근위대 주둔지로 돌아가 대기해라! 두 번 다시 이런 일은 없어야 할 거다!","source_cn":"殿下宽容，但军纪不可废。格温妮丝队长，准备返回守备军驻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40195C5018134D97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721506008:1":{"text":"...네, 사령관님.","source_cn":"……是，司令。属下遵命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x972DED43E809FAF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721506009:1":{"text":"실례했습니다, 왕자님. 일정을 지체할 수 없으니 어서 출발하시지요.","source_cn":"让殿下见笑了，别耽误了您的行程，我们现在出发吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE53579F2F8A103AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721506010:1":{"text":"그래.","source_cn":"走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90D5CC2650CAC0B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721506011:1":{"text":"근위병